"""Eight new fixed-output source tests only; no launch/nativechild/input."""
import datetime,hashlib,json,pathlib,platform,subprocess,sys
P=pathlib.Path(__file__).parent;names=['test-child-contract.py','run-child-contract-tests.py','outer-driver.py','inner-adapter.py','output-contract.json','runtime-delta-proof.json','guest-profile-v2.json'];pins={n:hashlib.sha256((P/n).read_bytes()).hexdigest() for n in names}
r=subprocess.run([sys.executable,str(P/'test-child-contract.py')],capture_output=True,text=True);assert pins=={n:hashlib.sha256((P/n).read_bytes()).hexdigest() for n in names}
row={'scope':'8NEW fixed child-output source contracts, no nativechild/RAM/input/guest','utc':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'platform':platform.platform(),'sources':pins,'returncode':r.returncode,'stdout':r.stdout,'stderr':r.stderr,'guest_qualified':False};f=P/('child-contract-tests-'+platform.system().lower()+'-'+datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).strftime('%Y%m%dT%H%M%S%fZ')+'.json');assert not f.exists();f.write_bytes((json.dumps(row,indent=2)+'\n').encode());print(json.dumps({'receipt':str(f),'returncode':r.returncode}));raise SystemExit(r.returncode)
